    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Core Rulebook</i></p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>One of your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skills\" title=\"Skills\">Skills</a> is particularly well honed.</p><p><b>Effect:</b> Choose one <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skill\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skill\">Skill</a> in which you are <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Trained\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Trained\">Trained</a>. You gain a +5 competence bonus on all <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skill_Checks\" title=\"Skill Checks\">Skill Checks</a> made with that <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skill\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skill\">Skill</a>.</p><p><b>Special:</b> This Feat may be selected multiple times. Its effects do not stack. Each time you take this Feat, it applies to a different <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Trained_Skill\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Trained Skill\">Trained Skill</a>.</p>",
